# Brinelab Tower's spill lab (CIPlay brinelab_tower_acid, 11-08; in a test world 'CI ...', under CIGapsWatchHealth, no
# CIGapsSuit). Points as in its recipe: the sample annex east of the loading yard (shed x 44..50, z -24..-18, floor about
# 3.2, door in the south wall at x 45.5..47), the acid zone bl_spill at 47 -21 (r 2.6, safe=suit), the suit box at
# 42.6 -23, the drain lever behind the annex at 47 -16.6, the locker at 49.2 -18.9. Without the suit the floor burns;
# the lever hides the zone, then the floor is safe. The suit run is brinelab_tower_acidsuit.
island Brinelab Tower keep
offset 0.978 2.1699
hour 11
weather Calm

# Outside: the annex, its door and sign from the loading yard; the lever round the back
picture bl_spill_out 40 5 -32 47 3.5 -21
picture bl_spill_back 52 5 -12 47 3.5 -17

# In through the door without a suit: the acid burns
expect shown blspill
at 46.25 -25
walk 46.25 -25 to 46.25 -23 to 47 -21
wait 5
expect message brine acid
expect hurt 15
picture bl_spill_in 46 5 -23.2 48.5 3.3 -19
walk 47 -21 to 46.25 -23 to 46.25 -26
# (the way out is through the acid too: counted here, so the drained walk below starts from none)
expect hurt 1

# Round the back to the drain lever: the acid goes, the floor is safe
walk 46.25 -26 to 51.5 -25 to 51.5 -16.5 to 47.6 -16
use bldrain
wait 2
expect hidden blspill
walk 47.6 -16 to 51.5 -16.5 to 51.5 -25 to 46.25 -25 to 46.25 -23 to 47 -21 to 48.6 -19.4
wait 5
expect unhurt
open Sample annex locker
wait 2
expect item Battery 2
picture bl_spill_dry 46 5 -23.2 48.5 3.3 -19
